{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54246","headline":"六合怀古诗 废清风亭 · 郏滂","name":"六合怀古诗 废清风亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧县元基城巽隅，亭帘高槛蘸清滁。\n风生六月思裘褐，百里恩波剸割余。\n（〖1〗《嘉靖志》题注：「《嘉定志》：唐时县治有清风亭，县令独孤及建。\n至郏滂时已废。\n」〖2〗《光绪志》诗末注：「士林馆在竹镇，地多习儒业。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郏滂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}